    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.3
  m_Text: "<color=#FFD700>Th\xE0nh c\xF4ng:</color> T\u1EA5n th\u0103ng \u0111\u1EA1i c\u1EA3nh gi\u1EDBi, m\u1EDF kh\xF3a s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh m\u1EDBi!\n<color=#FF5555>Th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i:</color> B\u1ECB Thi\xEAn Ki\u1EBFp ph\u1EA3n ph\u1EC7, <color=#FF3333><b>t\u1ED5n th\u1EA5t 25% Tu Vi</b></color>!\n<i>N\u1EBFu ch\u01B0a t\u1EF1 tin, h\xE3y ch\u1ECDn 'C\u1EE7ng C\u1ED1' \u0111\u1EC3 n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p phi ki\u1EBFm. H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng s\u1EBD h\u1ECFi l\u1EA1i sau m\u1ED7i khi v\u01B0\u1EE3t t\u1EA7ng.</i>"
